y to reproduce this gif\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4ba67aed-af93-478f-8a44-5af8216e6225)\n\n1 - Add a Path2D node.\n2 - Create curve points at right angles until that 'imperfection' occurs in the green line. It doesn't always happen at the second point; you might need to add more points.\n\nSee the video\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n...","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116901/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116901/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}